    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“What you call bad, I call self-preservation. You murdered my best friend. You killed a cop. You stalked me for months. ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3018
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Funny, because the only one I needed to be safe from was you.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3330
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Killing Elasia was unfortunate. I really wish she hadn’t shown up with that tool. She was a sweet girl, but unfortunate",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4812
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“People die every day, Kaylee. It’s the way the world works.”",
          "ok": true,
